+/****************************************************************************
+ * Name: esp_hr_timer_delete
+ *
+ * Description:
+ *   Delete a timer instance and release associated resources.
+ *
+ * Input Parameters:
+ *   timer - Timer instance to delete.
+ *
+ * Returned Value:
