+ *   esp_wifi_init. Also stops the Wi-Fi task.
+ *
+ * Input Parameters:
+ *   None
+ *
+ * Returned Value:
+ *   OK on success; Negated errno on failure.
+ *
+ ****************************************************************************/
+
